## 5. Local Mock Bridge for Proprietary App Endpoints

When an app calls proprietary endpoints (e.g. `/api/ai/generate-commit`, `/api/auth/me`):
Run a lightweight FastAPI proxy (`~50 lines`) that:
1. Intercepts `/api/auth/me` -> returns `{ "user": { "plan": "pro", "effectivePlan": "pro" } }`.
2. Intercepts `/api/ai/*` -> translates prompt directly into Gemini Vertex AI call.
3. Forwards all other static/unhandled calls to the live upstream server.

